  (text "DESIGN NOTE: master uses PTV111-3415A-B103 (rear-facing shaft). The originally requested -1415A is vertical-shaft and mechanically incompatible with a rear panel."
    (at 25 275 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5486a3d3-9151-4462-bbc7-feb541b34c39")
  )
  (text "CHASSIS is isolated from circuit GND by default; R17/C16 are DNP configuration options. USB shield and connector shell land on CHASSIS."
    (at 25 282 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "2702f906-c0ff-4046-9f16-437d81323c3b")
  )
  (text "PCM5122 module U6 follows Adafruit 6421 dual-header pin order; MCLK is intentionally unused. Native USB D+/D- include USBLC6-2 and 22R series damping."
    (at 25 289 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "5592f9cb-eed5-4918-a140-ec91aa5004fb")
  )
